window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Things are going from bad to worse in The Five Kingdoms as the cult of Ardent Lilly works to cause chaos and build a massive demon army.</p> <p>With so many lives at stake and despite his hopes to the contrary, Danny finds himself drawn deeper into the fight.</p> <p>And the first thing he has to do?</p> <p>Rescue the woman who betrayed and murdered him.</p> <p>Once Lyra is safe, it’s a race to defeat the leaders of the cult before they can bring their plans to fruition.</p> <p>With the Fate of The Five Kingdoms resting in the balance, can this former Marine defeat Ardent Lilly’s cult once and for all?</p>"; 
